# ⛔ MAXFIY: Firebase service account kaliti va shunga o'xshash sirlar.
# Repoga TUSHMASLIGI shart — tushsa kalitni bekor qilib qaytadan yaratish kerak.
# Naqshlar ATAYLAB keng: kalit fayl nomi yuklab olinganda tasodifiy bo'ladi
# (masalan "...-adminsdk-fbsvc-e2bc16ed46.json") va qo'lda qayta nomlanganda
# ".txt" ham bo'lishi mumkin — bittasi o'tib ketsa kalit GitHub'ga chiqadi.
*firebase-adminsdk*
*service-account*.json
*service_account*.json
planning-with-ai*
planning with ai*
fcm*.json
google-services.json
